<lead>Discounting one cash flow, in Python</lead>
<pre lang="python">def pv(cash, rate, years):
    # one cash flow, discounted back to today
    return cash / (1 + rate) ** years

print(f"{pv(100, 0.08, 5):.2f}")  # "68.06"</pre>
<text color="muted">With no lang, a block is coloured only when highlight.js is confident:</text>
<pre>the result was 68.06 and nothing else</pre>
